<section class="topic-kpi-section" aria-labelledby="kpi-topic-heading">
  <h2 id="kpi-topic-heading" class="kpi-topic-title">suggested KPIs for this topic</h2>

  <p class="kpi-topic-intro">
    These KPIs help you build a culture where creativity is visible, shared, and continuously improving.
    They focus on idea generation, expression, collaboration, and applying innovative thinking to real work.
  </p>

  <div class="expandable-container kpi-expandable-container">


    <!-- 1. Overcoming the Creative Scarcity Fallacy -->
    <div class="expandable-item">
      <h3 class="expandable-title" data-target="kpi-scarcity">
        overcoming the creative scarcity fallacy
        <svg class="expand-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
             viewBox="0 0 331.65 100.99" style="width:24px">
          <polygon fill="#4e50a2" points="0 0 161.57 100.99 331.65 0 0 0"/>
        </svg>
      </h3>

      <div class="expandable-content" id="kpi-scarcity">
        <ul class="kpi-list">
          <li>Track how often team members share ideas openly in meetings or written formats.</li>
          <li>Encourage at least one shared idea per person per week (internal or external).</li>
          <li>Measure reduction in “idea hoarding” behaviors (e.g., reluctance to contribute).</li>
          <li>Monitor how frequently ideas evolve through discussion rather than staying static.</li>
          <li>Assess team comfort level in expressing unfinished or early-stage ideas.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 2. Idea Generation & Everyday Innovation -->
    <div class="expandable-item">
      <h3 class="expandable-title" data-target="kpi-idea-generation">
        idea generation &amp; everyday innovation
        <svg class="expand-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
             viewBox="0 0 331.65 100.99" style="width:24px">
          <polygon fill="#4e50a2" points="0 0 161.57 100.99 331.65 0 0 0"/>
        </svg>
      </h3>

      <div class="expandable-content" id="kpi-idea-generation">
        <ul class="kpi-list">
          <li>Track the number of project-based insights or lessons identified per project.</li>
          <li>Identify moments where teams adapted to unexpected challenges or constraints.</li>
          <li>Measure how often new approaches replace “standard” methods.</li>
          <li>Capture and document innovative solutions for future reuse.</li>
          <li>Encourage recognition of small, incremental innovations—not just major breakthroughs.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 3. Making Thinking Visible -->
    <div class="expandable-item">
      <h3 class="expandable-title" data-target="kpi-visibility">
        making thinking visible
        <svg class="expand-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
             viewBox="0 0 331.65 100.99" style="width:24px">
          <polygon fill="#4e50a2" points="0 0 161.57 100.99 331.65 0 0 0"/>
        </svg>
      </h3>

      <div class="expandable-content" id="kpi-visibility">
        <ul class="kpi-list">
          <li>Track how often teams articulate the reasoning behind decisions—not just outcomes.</li>
          <li>Measure use of storytelling to explain technical solutions.</li>
          <li>Monitor frequency of knowledge sharing through internal sessions or external platforms.</li>
          <li>Assess whether clients can clearly understand your approach within minutes.</li>
          <li>Encourage documentation of insights in formats that others can learn from.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 4. Collaboration & Idea Development -->
    <div class="expandable-item">
      <h3 class="expandable-title" data-target="kpi-collaboration">
        collaboration &amp; idea development
        <svg class="expand-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
             viewBox="0 0 331.65 100.99" style="width:24px">
          <polygon fill="#4e50a2" points="0 0 161.57 100.99 331.65 0 0 0"/>
        </svg>
      </h3>

      <div class="expandable-content" id="kpi-collaboration">
        <ul class="kpi-list">
          <li>Measure how often ideas are improved through group discussion.</li>
          <li>Encourage cross-disciplinary input during problem-solving sessions.</li>
          <li>Track participation levels in collaborative planning or storyboarding exercises.</li>
          <li>Assess whether multiple perspectives are incorporated into final solutions.</li>
          <li>Reduce reliance on isolated problem-solving in favor of shared thinking.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 5. Applying Innovation to Real Work -->
    <div class="expandable-item">
      <h3 class="expandable-title" data-target="kpi-application">
        applying innovation to real work
        <svg class="expand-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
             viewBox="0 0 331.65 100.99" style="width:24px">
          <polygon fill="#4e50a2" points="0 0 161.57 100.99 331.65 0 0 0"/>
        </svg>
      </h3>

      <div class="expandable-content" id="kpi-application">
        <ul class="kpi-list">
          <li>Track how often innovative ideas are implemented in projects.</li>
          <li>Measure the impact of new approaches on project outcomes (efficiency, clarity, risk reduction).</li>
          <li>Identify repeatable innovations that become standard practice.</li>
          <li>Assess how frequently teams revisit and refine past solutions.</li>
          <li>Encourage linking innovation directly to client value and project success.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 6. Building a Sustainable Innovation Culture -->
    <div class="expandable-item">
      <h3 class="expandable-title" data-target="kpi-culture">
        building a sustainable innovation culture
        <svg class="expand-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
             viewBox="0 0 331.65 100.99" style="width:24px">
          <polygon fill="#4e50a2" points="0 0 161.57 100.99 331.65 0 0 0"/>
        </svg>
      </h3>

      <div class="expandable-content" id="kpi-culture">
        <ul class="kpi-list">
          <li>Measure consistency of idea-sharing behaviors over time.</li>
          <li>Track how often innovation is recognized and reinforced by leadership.</li>
          <li>Assess whether team members feel safe contributing ideas without judgment.</li>
          <li>Monitor growth in the range and quality of ideas produced.</li>
          <li>Evaluate whether innovation becomes a visible and expected part of daily work.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


  </div>

  <p class="kpi-topic-footer">
    Choose a KPI from each category to build a culture where ideas are shared, refined,
    and applied—turning creativity into a consistent advantage rather than a rare event.
  </p>
</section>


<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    const titles = document.querySelectorAll('.kpi-expandable-container .expandable-title');

    titles.forEach(function (title) {
      title.addEventListener('click', function () {
        const parent = this.closest('.expandable-item');
        const targetId = this.getAttribute('data-target');
        const content = document.getElementById(targetId);
        if (!parent || !content) return;

        const isActive = parent.classList.contains('active');
        parent.classList.toggle('active', !isActive);
        content.style.display = !isActive ? 'block' : 'none';
      });
    });
  });
</script>